blurb = "A look from behind a sago palm and stone lantern, above a neighboring thatched roof, into the goings-on at an unidentified teahouse in Akasaka, one station past Goyu (present-day Toyokawa City in Aichi).

Waitresses are serving tea in the room to the left. A country geisha is applying makeup in the room to the right."
